ame itself, reads and writes going to its fast locals and cells, so a write is seen by the"] [260 1 "// frame's code at its next load (the loop's and the compiled code's loads read f.Fast and f.Cells, never a copy:"] [261 1 "// survey \"Design: 219\"); a name none of the code's goes to the frame's extra locals."] [264 1 "// FrameLocalsProxyType is the proxy's type (\"FrameLocalsProxy\", registered as a Mapping by _collections_abc)."] [269 1 "// frameSlot is one of a code's names in co_localsplusnames' order: the fast locals (a parameter that is a cell read"] [270 1 "// through its cell), then the cells that are no parameter, then the free variables."] [273 18 "// the index in f.Fast or f.Cells, -1 for the other"] [274 18 "// an earlier slot has the name (each)"] [310 1 "// slotValue is s's value in f, nil when unbound."] [339 1 "// slotOf is framelocalsproxy_getkeyindex: the slot of key's name, an exact str by its text, else any key by its hash"] [340 1 "// and ==; read: only a bound one. -1 when none."] [392 1 "// set is framelocalsproxy_setitem (v nil: del): a local's slot written, never removed; else the extra locals."] [424 1 "// each calls fn on the bound names and their values in order, then the extra locals'. A name twice among the slots"] [425 1 "// (an inlined comprehension's own name in a fast slot beside the function's cell of that name, while the comprehension"] [426 1 "// runs: GH-128396's case, one slot in CPython holding the plain value) gives its first bound slot's value."] [452 1 "// dict is the proxy's items as a new dict (PyDict_Update(dict, proxy))."] [464 1 "// merge is framelocalsproxy_merge: other a dict or a proxy, each of its keys set; false for another mapping."] [564 2 "// nb_or: either operand the proxy, the result a dict of the left's items, then the right's"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[12 23] [80 14] [80 24] [132 42] [147 28] [220 25] [221 19] [221 29] [240 15] [241 25] [348 24] [358 22] [380 21] [381 26] [431 25]